              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin(3\\pi-x)-\\tg(\\pi-x)=\\frac{1-\\sin^2\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{2}+x\\right)}{\\sin 2x}.\"></span></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Ука­жи­те корни этого урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[7\\pi;8{,}75\\pi]\"></span> .</li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T19:41:07.421887+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{\\pm \\frac{2\\pi}{3}+2\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{22\\pi}{3}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{26\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T19:41:07.421887+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"83616868-17c5-4cdd-a521-83ae45bb68ff\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p><p>а)  Упро­стим пра­вую часть урав­не­ния:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{1-\\sin^2\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{2}+x\\right)}{\\sin 2x}=\\frac{1-\\cos^2 x}{\\sin 2x}=\\frac{\\sin^2 x}{2\\sin x\\cos x}=\\frac{\\sin x}{2\\cos x}=\\frac{1}{2}\\tg x,\"></span></p></center><p>со­кра­щать на  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin x\"></span> можно при усло­вии  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin x\\ne 0\"></span>.  Далее по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin(3\\pi-x)-\\tg(\\pi-x)=\\frac{1}{2}\\tg x\\Leftrightarrow\\sin x+\\tg x=\\frac{1}{2}\\tg x\\Leftrightarrow2\\sin x=-\\tg x\\Leftrightarrow2\\sin x=-\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos x},\\quad \\sin x\\ne0\\Leftrightarrow2=-\\frac{1}{\\cos x}\\Leftrightarrow\\cos x=-\\frac{1}{2}\\Leftrightarrow x=\\pm\\frac{2\\pi}{3}+2\\pi k,\\ k\\in\\mathbb{Z}.\"></span></span></p></center><p>б)  Отберём корни при по­мо­щи три­го­но­мет­ри­че­ской окруж­но­сти. Под­хо­дят  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{22\\pi}{3}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{26\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1"
                ]
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
