                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\tg 2x=2\\cos 2x\\cdot \\ctg x\"></span>.</li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Най­ди­те все корни урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\pi;\\frac{\\pi}{2}]\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T18:53:33.853478+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{-\\frac{\\pi}{6}+\\pi k;\\frac{\\pi}{6}+\\pi k;\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б) <span data-inline-latex=\"\\pm \\frac{\\pi}{6}\"></span> ,  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\pm \\frac{\\pi}{2}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T18:53:33.853478+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"a)\"><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"869a8aa1-69ce-4857-97a3-504fedd6b43d\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/>Урав­не­ние опре­де­ле­но при  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos 2x\\ne 0\"></span> и  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin x\\ne 0\"></span>. Пре­об­ра­зу­ем урав­не­ние при этих усло­ви­ях:<center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"\\operatorname{tg}2x=2\\cos 2x\\cdot\\operatorname{ctg}x\\Leftrightarrow\\frac{\\sin 2x}{\\cos 2x}=2\\cos 2x\\cdot\\frac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}\\Leftrightarrow\\frac{2\\sin x\\cos x}{\\cos 2x}=2\\cos 2x\\cdot\\frac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}\\Leftrightarrow\\sin^2x\\cos x=\\cos^2 2x\\cos x\\Leftrightarrow\\cos x(\\cos^2 2x-\\sin^2x)=0\\Leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos x&amp;=0,\\\\\\cos 2x-\\sin x&amp;=0,\\\\\\cos 2x+\\sin x&amp;=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\\Leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos x&amp;=0,\\\\\\cos 2x-\\sin x&amp;=0,\\\\\\cos 2x+\\sin x&amp;=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\\Leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos x&amp;=0,\\\\2\\sin^2x+\\sin x-1&amp;=0,\\\\2\\sin^2x-\\sin x-1&amp;=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\\Leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos x&amp;=0,\\\\\\sin x&amp;=\\pm\\frac12,\\\\\\sin x&amp;=\\pm1\\end{aligned}\\right.\\Leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}x&amp;=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k,\\\\x&amp;=\\pm\\frac{\\pi}{6}+\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right.,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb Z.\"></span></span></p></center><p> Числа, со­дер­жа­щи­е­ся в най­ден­ных се­ри­ях ре­ше­ний, удо­вле­тво­ря­ют усло­ви­ям  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos 2x\\ne 0\"></span> и  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin x\\ne 0\"></span>.</p></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">От­бе­рем корни при по­мо­щи еди­нич­ной окруж­но­сти (см. рис.). Под­хо­дят: <span data-inline-latex=\"\\pm \\frac{\\pi}{6}\"></span> ,  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\pm \\frac{\\pi}{2}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1"
                ]
              },
